{"title":"Prince Ali","artist":"Robin Williams","date":"2026-08-18","sourceId":"14756908:014","sourceHash":"a47b8a97487b675f0cb63232866c449e416373e23bd42c130a5ee7567af5c6e7","duration":192.8,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":6.919546,"end":9.387,"text":"Make way","translation":"길을 비켜","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":9.427,"end":11.57,"text":"For Prince Ali!","translation":"알리 왕자님","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":11.609977,"end":13.683,"text":"Say: \"Hey!","translation":"말해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":13.722993,"end":18.327,"text":"It's Prince Ali!\"","translation":"알리 왕자님이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":18.366984,"end":20.603,"text":"Hey clear the way in the ol' bazaar","translation":"이봐 낡은 시장 길을 비켜","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":20.64254,"end":21.729,"text":"Hey you! Let us through-","translation":"이봐 너희 우리를 지나가게 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":21.768707,"end":23.354,"text":"It's a bright new star","translation":"찬란한 새 별이 왔어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":23.394,"end":28.044,"text":"Oh come be the first on your block to meet his eye!","translation":"어서 네 동네에서 처음으로 그의 눈을 마주해 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":28.084535,"end":29.333,"text":"Make way! Here he comes!","translation":"길을 비켜 그가 온다","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":29.373,"end":30.784,"text":"Ring bells! Bang the drums!","translation":"종을 울려 북을 쳐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":30.824,"end":32.642,"text":"Ah! You're gonna love this guy!","translation":"아 넌 이 멋진 사내를 좋아할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":32.682,"end":37.785,"text":"Prince Ali - fabulous he - Ali Ababwa","translation":"알리 왕자님 눈부신 그 알리 아바브와","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":37.825,"end":40.119,"text":"Genuflect, show some respect:","translation":"무릎 꿇고 경의를 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":40.158912,"end":42.929,"text":"Down on one knee.","translation":"한쪽 무릎을 꿇어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":42.968526,"end":45.274,"text":"Now try your best to stay calm","translation":"자 이제 진정하려 애써 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":45.313741,"end":47.619,"text":"Brush off your sunday salaam","translation":"일요일 인사도 털고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":47.658957,"end":52.6,"text":"Then come and meet his spectacular coterie!","translation":"그의 화려한 수행단을 만나 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":52.639637,"end":58.103,"text":"Prince Ali - mighty is he - Ali Ababwa","translation":"알리 왕자님 위대한 그 알리 아바브와","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":58.142766,"end":63.629,"text":"Strong as ten regular men definitely","translation":"보통 사내 열 명만큼 강해 정말로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":63.669,"end":65.626,"text":"He faced the galloping hordes!","translation":"질주하는 무리를 맞섰어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":65.666,"end":67.46,"text":"A hundred bad guys with swords!","translation":"검 든 악당 백 명을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":67.5,"end":69.619,"text":"Who sent those goons to their lords?","translation":"그 깡패들을 주인에게 보낸 건 누구","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":69.659864,"end":71.861,"text":"Why- Prince Ali!","translation":"왜 알리 왕자님이지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":71.90059,"end":72.001,"text":"(Men)","translation":"남자들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":72.016689,"end":75.181,"text":"He's got seventy-five golden camels","translation":"그에겐 황금 낙타 일흔다섯 마리가 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":75.221,"end":76.841,"text":"(Don't they look lovely June?)","translation":"정말 사랑스럽지 않니 준","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":76.881,"end":77.375,"text":"(Girls)","translation":"여자들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":77.415,"end":80.103,"text":"Purple peacocks he's got fifty-three!","translation":"자주빛 공작도 쉰세 마리나 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":80.143673,"end":81.45,"text":"(Fabulous Harry, I love the feathers)","translation":"근사해 해리 깃털이 정말 좋아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":81.49,"end":86.733,"text":"When it comes to exotic type mammals...","translation":"이국적인 포유류라면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":86.772971,"end":88.08,"text":"Has he gotta zoo-","translation":"동물원을 가졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":88.119728,"end":88.974,"text":"I'm tellin' you!","translation":"내 말이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":89.013696,"end":91.284,"text":"It's a world class menagerie!","translation":"세계적인 동물원이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":91.324,"end":96.032,"text":"Prince Ali - handsome as he - Ali Ababwa","translation":"알리 왕자님 잘생긴 그 알리 아바브와","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":96.072562,"end":101.292,"text":"That physique! How can I speak? Weak at the knee...","translation":"저 몸매 말이 나와 무릎이 풀려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":101.331882,"end":104.705,"text":"Well get on out in that square","translation":"자 저 광장으로 나가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":104.745,"end":109.813,"text":"Adjust your veil and prepare","translation":"베일을 고쳐 쓰고 준비해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":109.853605,"end":110.266,"text":"To gawk and grovel and stare at Prince Ali!","translation":"알리 왕자님을 넋 놓고 우러러보고 바라봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":110.306,"end":112.809,"text":"He's got ninety-five white Persian monkeys","translation":"흰 페르시아 원숭이도 아흔다섯 마리나 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":112.84898,"end":114.167,"text":"He's got the monkeys!","translation":"원숭이도 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":114.207,"end":114.991,"text":"Lets see the monkeys!","translation":"원숭이를 보자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":115.031655,"end":117.685,"text":"And to view them he charges no fee!","translation":"보는 데 돈도 받지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":117.725,"end":119.496,"text":"(He's generous! So generous!)","translation":"그는 관대해 정말 관대해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":119.536,"end":123.083,"text":"He's got slaves, he's got servants and flunkies.","translation":"노예도 하인도 부하도 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":123.12381,"end":124.082,"text":"Proud to work for him-","translation":"그를 위해 일하는 걸 자랑스러워해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":124.122,"end":125.638,"text":"They bow to his whim-","translation":"그의 뜻에 고개 숙이고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":125.678,"end":126.218,"text":"Love serving him!","translation":"그를 모시는 걸 사랑해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":126.258503,"end":128.006,"text":"They're just lousy with loyalty","translation":"충성심이 넘쳐나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":128.046,"end":130.409,"text":"To Ali!","translation":"알리에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":130.449705,"end":133.278,"text":"Prince Ali!","translation":"알리 왕자님","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}